      "value": "Came on here to also request this\n\nI would love to sync my camera with someone elses or theirs to mine\n\ntakes the absolute guesswork out of recording and ensures everyone is on the same page\n\nYou can even coordinate recording on someone's system while someone else does the camera handling possibly",
